001005r 1               ; the laser pointer: a dotted line from the grabber the way it would go out,
001005r 1               ; to the edge, or to what it would grab (marked with a little ring).  It
001005r 1               ; follows the grabber's own path: the rope end is at length * dir / 128,
001005r 1               ; the length going 7, 10, 13 ... as it would going out; worked out here by
001005r 1               ; adding 3 * dir / 128 (8.8) each step, which comes to the same pixels.
